      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Current: VRC+: Can make 3 groups\n\n----\n\nVisitor: Cannot make groups, nor upload avatars, nor upload worlds\n\nNew User: Can make 1 group for free, upload avatars, upload worlds\n\nUser: Can make 2 groups for free\n\nKnown User: Can make 3 groups for free\n\nTrusted User: Can make up to 5 groups for free\n\nVRC+: Can make up to 10 groups\n\n----\n\nI can't think of a reason one person would make 10 groups outside of memes...\n\nBut the point is more to just let us make at least 1 for free, possibly scale it with your trust, and VRC+ is like a luxury.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
