      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I agree that you should need a certain user rank to create a group, however I find people suggesting you should need known/trusted rank being way too excessive!\n\nCurrently \"New User\" allows you to upload avatars/worlds and \"User\" to submit worlds to community labs. Groups is a core feature and should be unlocked around the same time as other core features becomes available to you. VRC+ should let you create more groups though as that fits with it also increasing your favourites tabs.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
