      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5a565acbb301553d0104ba88|full_name}: probably make more sense to have new user and/or user make 1 group, and then leave it at that, then let trusted make 2 new ones, then vrc+, maybe or maybe not additional groups, but instead perhaps let them have other perks, like choosing their delimiter number or other things like that.  having a bajillion groups comes off as unnecessary, and you'll get more people making groups just for banner pictures and jokes instead of meaningful ones, flooding the database and api requests with excess nonsense.",
