      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The VRChat Team must be paid some how; they pay for the hosting of VRChat so that we, the users, can enter for free and upload as much content as we want, they also added a lot of useful features so we can have a better experience in VRChat, people do not work for free.\n\nI don't believe they will remove VRC+ from groups.",
