  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-12-01T03:29:53.088Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Current wording being used in the article and the video, seems to present the idea that the requirement for VRChat+ isn't really decided which means that there is a chance \"group creation\" may not become accessible for non-VRChat+ users.\n\n\"We're unsure if VRChat+ will always be required to make a group in VRChat\" (https://youtu.be/b6c_kDRJG2A?t=237)\n\n\"This requirement could change in the future\" (https://help.vrchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/11706395001875-Creating-a-Group)\n\nI think a big portion of the community may get hurt by this requirement, think of groups that may just be made for niche topics, or small creators that may not be capable of paying for a subscription who may want to develop some of their small community too.\n\nI believe people should be able to create communities for each other, and interact with them without being required to subscribe to VRChat+ because i believe this system will be a big contributor to interactions between players.",
